	(text "MCU_VDDA = VCC through R203 (0R), bypass C206/C207 + C208/C213 to AGND.\nAVCC LDO remains for external analog amplifiers only.\nJ201: 1=3V3, 2=GND, 3=M1_BRKIN, 4=M2_BRKIN.\nFAULT pullups: external open-drain HEALTH holds LOW while healthy.\nTimer break polarity HIGH; unplugged defaults to brake.\nNo autonomous trip comparator fitted.\nCurrent limits and external fault source remain to be designed."

		(exclude_from_sim no)

		(at 245 230 0)

		(effects

			(font

				(size 1.27 1.27)

			)

			(justify left top)

		)

		(uuid "2c962573-a3d8-498d-a838-0ac358611ae8")

	)

	(text "M1 TIMER0: PA8/9/10 AF1; PB13/14 AF2, PB15 AF1.\nBRKIN PB12 AF4.\nM2 TIMER7: PC6/7 AF3, PC8 AF2; PC0/1/2 AF0.\nBRKIN PA6 AF4.\nM1 currents PA0/1/2; M2 currents PA3/4/5 (ADC0/ADC1).\nIBUS: PC3 / PC5; VBUS PC4; NTC PE7 / PE8 (ADC2).\nHall M1 PB4/5/0 TIMER2; M2 PD12/13/14 TIMER3. Release PB4 JTAG, keep SWD.\nShared SPI2 PC10/11/12 AF2; GPIO chip selects PE2 / PE3.\nVA/VB/VC/COM and M2_VBUS: power-sheet testpoints."

		(exclude_from_sim no)

		(at 15 220 0)

		(effects

			(font

				(size 1.27 1.27)

			)

			(justify left top)

		)

		(uuid "c28cd2f5-f130-4767-a397-30b154ecaf90")

	)

	(text "Onboard debugger: HSLink page; R8901..R8905 are default-open.\nJ200 external probe: never use simultaneously with onboard probe.\nUSART1 bridge PD5/TX, PD6/RX; target must be powered before enabling links."

		(exclude_from_sim no)

		(at 150 195 0)

		(effects

			(font

				(size 1.27 1.27)

			)

			(justify left top)

		)

		(uuid "e37c877a-e032-488a-ac93-13f90eecfcb8")

	)

